[Internal Collaboration Group Announcement · Temporary Capacity Assurance Group] {date} {time}
@all Just received notice: the utilization level of the {site} production cluster has reached 95%, and the peak-season switchover has been moved up to {date} {time}.
From now on, three tasks will proceed in parallel and depend on each other: First, the retrieval side immediately pulls all stress-test postmortems and all previous capacity expansion records for this cluster over the past six months; second, the analysis side recalculates the gap based on 1.6 times the traffic; third, the operations side prepares a phased capacity expansion change and rollback plan. If the conclusion of any step changes, the actions of the other two steps must be adjusted synchronously.
Also: the air-conditioner outdoor unit noise complaint for {device} belongs to Logistics; do not take it in this group.
Judgment: impact on online production counts as 2 points; less than 3 days until switchover, add 1 point; there is already a customer complaint today, add 1 point; cumulative 4 points, corresponding to urgent (0 low, 1 normal, 2 high, 3 points and above urgent). The retrieval, analysis, and execution parties are linked in series and need dynamic order adjustment; a single role cannot complete it, so it is judged as requiring orchestration and routed to the orchestrator.
